('127.685.d.3.R',4,'A digital camera used to add photos to a website is an:','["storage chip", "output device", "network cable", "input device"]'::jsonb,3,'Cameras send images in.','original'),
('127.685.d.3.S',3,'An acceptable use policy (AUP) explains:','["how technology may and may not be used", "the lunch menu", "building hours", "dress colors"]'::jsonb,0,'AUPs set rules.','original'),
('127.685.d.3.S',4,'Violating a school''s acceptable use policy can lead to:','["a trophy", "consequences such as losing access", "a bonus", "a free upgrade"]'::jsonb,1,'Policies have consequences.','original'),
