('127.685.d.3.U',3,'To find information on a narrow topic, a good search strategy is to use:','["specific keywords", "a blank search", "random symbols", "very vague words"]'::jsonb,0,'Specific terms narrow results.','original'),
('127.685.d.3.U',4,'After a search returns too many results, a researcher should:','["click randomly", "add more specific terms or filters", "give up", "delete the browser"]'::jsonb,1,'Refining improves relevance.','original'),
