('127.685.d.4.A',3,'A student turns lessons on layout and color into a new portfolio site. This shows:','["transfer of knowledge into original work", "skipping class", "copying a template exactly", "deleting files"]'::jsonb,0,'Applying learning creates original work.','original'),
('127.685.d.4.A',4,'Adapting a design you learned for desktops so it also works on phones shows:','["repetition", "adaptation of knowledge", "delay", "avoidance"]'::jsonb,1,'Adapting skills shows depth of understanding.','original'),
('127.685.d.4.B',3,'Protecting a website from attacks may involve installing a:','["frame", "poster", "firewall", "border"]'::jsonb,2,'Firewalls filter traffic.','original'),
('127.685.d.4.B',4,'Backing up a website regularly helps protect your work from:','["bright colors", "long names", "small fonts", "data loss from attacks or failures"]'::jsonb,3,'Backups preserve work.','original'),
('127.685.d.4.C',3,'A web team that builds a calendar of due dates for each task is:','["following a timeline", "skipping tasks", "guessing", "ignoring planning"]'::jsonb,0,'Timelines guide work.','original'),
