('127.685.d.4.D',3,'A designer should check that fonts and images used in a client site are:','["free of color", "very large", "properly licensed for that use", "very small"]'::jsonb,2,'Licensing applies to assets too.','original'),
('127.685.d.4.D',4,'Using a font without a proper license in a commercial site may lead to:','["free hosting", "a trophy", "extra speed", "a legal claim from the creator"]'::jsonb,3,'Unlicensed assets create legal risk.','original'),
('127.685.d.4.E',3,'A rubric for a web page might score items such as:','["design, content and functionality", "weather", "parking", "lunch"]'::jsonb,0,'Rubrics list quality criteria.','original'),
('127.685.d.4.E',4,'Using a rubric to evaluate pages keeps grading:','["random", "consistent and fair", "personal only", "hidden"]'::jsonb,1,'Rubrics standardize judging.','original'),
('127.685.d.4.F',3,'To reduce page load time, a designer can shrink image files by:','["enlarging them", "hiding them", "compressing them", "duplicating them"]'::jsonb,2,'Compression reduces size.','original'),
('127.685.d.4.F',4,'Optimizing a page for visitors with slow connections means:','["adding huge videos", "adding large images", "adding many animations", "keeping files small so pages load quickly"]'::jsonb,3,'Light pages suit slow connections.','original'),
('127.685.d.4.G',3,'Having a professional web developer look over your site is a form of:','["professional review", "peer pressure", "guessing", "self-criticism only"]'::jsonb,0,'Experts offer valuable feedback.','original'),
('127.685.d.4.G',4,'Reviewing your own site after a break helps you notice:','["nothing", "errors you missed before", "only praise", "fewer details"]'::jsonb,1,'Fresh eyes catch mistakes.','original'),
('127.685.d.4.H',3,'A website that sells products to shoppers is a:','["personal journal only", "school roster", "commerce site", "blank page"]'::jsonb,2,'Commerce sites sell goods.','original'),
('127.685.d.4.H',4,'A site that gives news and updates to readers has a primary function of:','["selling cars", "storing photos", "playing games", "informing its audience"]'::jsonb,3,'News sites inform.','original'),
('127.685.d.4.I',3,'A document that explains how a website was built for future developers is:','["technical documentation", "a poster", "a coupon", "a menu"]'::jsonb,0,'Technical docs describe systems.','original'),
