('127.685.d.4.J',4,'A company expecting a surge of visitors during a sale should choose a server that can:','["shut down", "shrink", "hide pages", "scale up to handle more traffic"]'::jsonb,3,'Scalability handles spikes.','original'),
('127.685.d.4.K',3,'A web host is a company that:','["stores a website''s files and serves them online", "repairs phones", "designs logos", "prints flyers"]'::jsonb,0,'Hosts keep sites available.','original'),
